# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only working folders. NEVER committed - the deployed wiki must stay
# small and must not redistribute source documents or third-party material.
#
#   references/         - team source material given to humans/AI as context
#                         (pitch decks, lab journals, papers, interview notes)
#   wiki-assets-source/ - raw images staged for upload to static.igem.wiki
#                         via the iGEM uploads tool
#
# Images, fonts and video NEVER live in this repo: upload them via
# https://teams.igem.org/go/deliverables/wiki/uploads and reference the
# static.igem.wiki URL the tool returns.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
references/
wiki-assets-source/

# Per-user Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json
